      "message": "To reduce duplication, consider re-introducing a common macro for the shared properties (`width`, `height`, `bits-per-pixel`, `v4l2-pixel-format`) and including it within `FPC1025_RAW_IMAGE_PROPS` and `FPC1025_REAL_IMAGE_PROPS`.\n\nFor example:\n```\n#define FPC1025_COMMON_IMAGE_PROPS \\\n\twidth \u003d \u003c160\u003e; \\\n\theight \u003d \u003c160\u003e; \\\n\tbits-per-pixel \u003d \u003c8\u003e; \\\n\tv4l2-pixel-format \u003d \"V4L2_PIX_FMT_GREY\";\n\n#define FPC1025_RAW_IMAGE_PROPS \\\n\tFPC1025_COMMON_IMAGE_PROPS \\\n\tframe-size \u003d \u003c26260\u003e;\n\n#define FPC1025_REAL_IMAGE_PROPS \\\n\tFPC1025_COMMON_IMAGE_PROPS \\\n\tframe-size \u003d \u003c25600\u003e;\n```",
